      "title": "Muere Gonzalo Suárez a los 92 años, Goya de Honor 2026",
      "url": "https://www.abc.es/play/cine/noticias/muere-cineasta-gonzalo-suarez-anos-20260929170957-nt.html",
      "drafted_source_count": 4,
      "sources_at_draft": [
        "Academia de Cine",
        "EL PAÍS",
